The {{Term/Store|Sanctum||Series, BotW, TotK, AoC}} is a recurring location in {{TLoZ Series}}.{{Exp Game|BotW, TotK, AoC}}<ref>{{Cite|'''Sanctum'''|Map|BotW}}</ref><ref>{{Cite|'''Sanctum'''|Map|TotK}}</ref><ref>{{Cite|Head toward the Sanctum to rescue {{Color AoC|Blue|King Rhoam}}!|Battle Log|AoC}}</ref>

==Features and Overview==
==={{BotW|-}}===
The Sanctum is the highest structure in [[Hyrule Castle (Dungeon)|Hyrule Castle]]. On [[Link]]'s [[Map]], it is marked as the location of [[Calamity Ganon]]. [[Zelda]] has been holding him back within his [[Ganon's Cocoon|Cocoon]] in the [[Throne Room]], which is located on the first floor of the Sanctum, for the past 100 years.<ref>{{Cite Book|quote= |book= CaC |publisher= |page= 253}}</ref> By entering the Throne Room, the final battle against Calamity Ganon will begin.

[[File:BotW Korok Seed Icon.png|left|40px]]
One [[Korok Seed Puzzle]] is located in the Sanctum. [[Leaves with Fairy Dust]] can be found at the end of the spire on top of the [[Sanctum]]. When [[Link]] interacts with them, a [[Korok]] will appear and give him a [[Korok Seed]].<ref>{{Cite|Yahaha! You found me!|Korok|BotW}}</ref>

