After luring Link to the Sanctum, [[Ganondorf]] summons two waves of [[Phantom Ganon]]s as a boss. During the fight, the first floor of the Sanctum, the [[Throne Room]], can be seen in pristine condition. Link is able to fight off the Phantom Ganons with the aid of the Sages, but the Demon King escapes after taunting them with a vision of his planned invasion of Hyrule. 

The room returns to its original state after the battle ends.

